  "body": "<a name=\"release-1-18-19-fixed\"></a>\n\n### Bug fixes\n\n- `pipx uninject` no longer removes a dependency the main package always needs, such as one marked `extra != \"cli\"`, when that package declares extras, and `pipx install --include-deps` with an extra now exposes the apps of such a dependency ([#2476](https://github.com/pypa/pipx/pull/2476)) by @hemtilva and @gaborbernat.\n\n[🐍 PyPI release](https://pypi.org/project/pipx/1.18.19/)\n\n[📜 Full Changelog](https://github.com/pypa/pipx/compare/1.18.18...1.18.19)\n",
